umentation Join Us --> Research Research Groups Observatories Key Laboratories Research Progress Research Programs Quick Links People Research Conferences Vacancies & Programs Location: Home > Research > Research Progress Research Progress • Researchers Report Dwarf Novae Unlikely to Be Type Ia Supernova Progenitors (2026-09-30) • Researchers Reveal Sharp Rise in Mass-Loss Rate Before a Rare Type Ia Superno... (2026-09-30) • Study Confirms Compact Companion around the RR Lyrae Star IY Lyr (2026-09-30) • Study Reports Gamma-Ray Excess Toward Radio-Quiet Narrow-Line Seyfert 1 Galax... (2026-09-28) • Research Advances Rapid Physical Inference for Type II Supernovae (2026-08-18) • Study Reveals Mi',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'free','primary','not_applicable',NULL,NULL,'https://english.ynao.cas.cn/research/rp/',NULL,1,'B','V2',200,'V2: institution certifiée 3/3, URL ouverte anonymement, titre et contenu vérifiés automatiquement. V3 réservé à une validation plus forte.','153fbfc5b16f62307069eaf6604b38739a2cf03ba7390bfa0e4253978477cbf9','3738bb0fa6ca2cca6bfa2d489d0b96b23309aa21c7a74d8568dda43ae1de238b',1,1,1,1 FROM sources WHERE root_url='https://english.ynao.cas.cn/' ON CONFLICT(canonical_hash) DO UPDATE SET consulted_at=excluded.consulted_at,http_status=excluded.http_status,content_sha256=excluded.content_sha256,exact_title=excluded.exact_title,factual_summary=excluded.factual_summary,active=1;
