elligent perception and recognition, automated reasoning, big data & intelligence computing, and intelligent robotics. The Information Technology Department aims to integrate technological innovation, results transformation and talent cultivation, empowering ecological environment protection in the Three Gorges Reservoir Area and industrial upgrading in the Chengdu-Chongqing Economic Circle.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'free','primary','not_applicable',NULL,NULL,'http://english.cigit.cas.cn/ra/research_areas/202312/t20231224_654234.html',NULL,3,'B','V2',200,'V2: institution certifiée 3/3, URL ouverte anonymement, titre et contenu vérifiés automatiquement. V3 réservé à une validation plus forte.','1c5784d31e4791263024d8380b6ff321f52e3e83139e1f83ccaa5a39a615ae30','2a0d03e6965d6ef04eae7143e113be82b6a8a9408448143dad7a13a5cbf7e743',1,1,1,1 FROM sources WHERE root_url='http://english.cigit.cas.cn/' ON CONFLICT(canonical_hash) DO UPDATE SET consulted_at=excluded.consulted_at,http_status=excluded.http_status,content_sha256=excluded.content_sha256,exact_title=excluded.exact_title,factual_summary=excluded.factual_summary,active=1;
