al fare or up to the rail fare of AC 2 tier class, whichever is less). Outstation trainees will also be provided free Boarding & Lodging during the training program, furt','[vc_row][vc_column][vc_single_image image=13557 img_size=full alignment=center onclick=custom_link link=https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSe2bvgR-6Q0A3cvLRIBldQZrhLP_k-Nu_M8kY13H7HNC4YaXQ/viewform][vc_column_text] [/vc_column_text][vc_column_text] 6 DAYS TRAINING PROGRAM : Applications are invited from AYUSH professionals, working as Teachers, Doctors, Scientists and Researchers for 6 days training program titled “Current Trend in R&D, modern scientific advances & technology for scientific understanding” at CSIR-IIIM Jammu Campus. The selected participants will be eligible for travel expenses reimbursement for their journey to the host institute from their hometown/home institute, both ways, as per GOI norms (Actual fare or up to the rail fare of AC 2 tier class, whichever is less). Outstation trainees will also be provided free Boarding & Lodging during the training program, furt',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'free','primary','not_applicable',NULL,NULL,'https://iiim.res.in/6-days-training-program-current-trend-in-rd-modern-scientific-advances-technology-for-scientific-understanding-organized-by-rmbd-ist-division-csir-iiim-from-10th-15th-oct-20/',NULL,3,'B','V2',200,'V2: institution certifiée 3/3, URL ouverte anonymement, titre et contenu vérifiés automatiquement. V3 réservé à une validation plus forte.','63bbb296ed99839cb99ea1aec686248b2b56b454f4a68161d74e6532e593988e','0abff703ea61a43c8bcbcdf081bf52978439df04f39683d0fee2c1edbd49bcf4',1,1,1,1 FROM sources WHERE root_url='https://iiim.res.in/' ON CONFLICT(canonical_hash) DO UPDATE SET consulted_at=excluded.consulted_at,http_status=excluded.http_status,content_sha256=excluded.content_sha256,exact_title=excluded.exact_title,factual_summary=excluded.factual_summary,active=1;
