y, social suffering, and general degradation of the environment. I will do everything possible for the prevention of accidents, occupational diseases, and protection of the environment in the interest of self, family, organization, community, and the nation at large.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'free','primary','not_applicable',NULL,NULL,'https://www.iict.res.in/GUIDELINES',NULL,1,'B','V2',200,'V2: institution certifiée 3/3, URL ouverte anonymement, titre et contenu vérifiés automatiquement. V3 réservé à une validation plus forte.','24b0957dff9b3a058450f32f3125203e966c328ddf708fa4009a21048dd72805','5b2eaaf4261e4ea2618fa661192169842093148f728ddeb6c84a6345b2d856e1',1,1,1,1 FROM sources WHERE root_url='https://www.iict.res.in/' ON CONFLICT(canonical_hash) DO UPDATE SET consulted_at=excluded.consulted_at,http_status=excluded.http_status,content_sha256=excluded.content_sha256,exact_title=excluded.exact_title,factual_summary=excluded.factual_summary,active=1;
